
# Built and local-only, never part of a release. `git add -A` at the repo root swept all of
# this into a commit and a tag once (v0.0.186), and a published module version cannot be
# rewritten, so it stays in that one zip. These lines are so it cannot happen a second time.
.DS_Store
/site/
/.worktrees/
/.claude/worktrees/
docs/sketchy/pygments-tony/build/
docs/sketchy/pygments-tony/*.egg-info/
